        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Metroplex\n- People: Juan Atkins, Terrence Dixon, Belleville Three\n- Places: Detroit, Belleville, Michigan\n- Topics: Techno, record labels\n\nFacts:\n- In 1985, Juan Atkins founded Metroplex in Detroit as a techno record label.\n- Juan Atkins is regarded as a techno pioneer.\n- Juan Atkins was one of the three people sometimes called the Belleville Three.\n- The Belleville Three attended high school together in Belleville, Michigan, near Detroit.\n- Terrence Dixon has released music on record labels including Tresor and Metroplex.",
